## Implementation facts

- **Stack**: React + TypeScript + Vite + Zustand; Tauri (Rust) for FS and launch actions
- **Windows**: Menu bar popover (browse/search/launch) and Dashboard (add/edit references); sync via Tauri `references_changed` events
- **Data**: `~/Library/Application Support/com.itsbohara.anchor/Anchor/data.json`
- **Package manager**: `bun` (see `AGENTS.md`)

## Design principles

Minimal, keyboard-first, fast, no clutter — see `docs/project.md` and `docs/menubar.md`.
